* Rebalanced the success chances when fermenting Wine of Zamorak.
* Increased the number of Coins that can be stored in the Player Owned House Chests.
* Scarab swarms in Pyramid Plunder will no longer attack you while you're trying to open a Sarcophagus.
* Everyone is now automatically opted-out of gaining experience from pushing the wheat in Puro-Puro. Players can opt-in by talking to the Elnock Inquisitor.

'''Combat Achievements'''
* Added Combat Achievements for the Phantom Muspah.

'''Other Changes'''
* Loot Keys will no longer be received if players are in a trade screen. Keys will now be dropped where the player died.
* Removed the delay when depositing Paydirt into the hopper at Motherlode Mine.
* The Slayer Helper now properly displays your Wilderness Slayer streak.
* The 10th Anniversary Dragon Candle has been correctly labelled as a fun weapon.
* There is now a Fossil Storage Crate at the Volcanic Mine Bank.
* The Party Room Museum expansion can now be accessed on free-to-play worlds.
* The Dragon Candle Dagger and Old School Jumper are now tagged as warm clothing.
* The animation that plays when waxing your Sled will now cancel if the player moves.
* The Sins of the Father display case in the Museum is now correctly labelled as a Master Quest.
* Having a Slayer Task streak of 16,000 no longer means you will get the max amount of Slayer Points for every Task you complete.
* Fixed a typo in the frog random event and in Warmhandz’s dialogue.
* Updated the banners in the Falador Party Room!
* Facial animations have been added to certain Birthday Event dialogues.

