==Other Changes==
* You can no longer receive a loot key if you are in a trade screen. The key will now be dropped where the player died.
* Removed the delay when depositing Paydirt into the hopper at Motherlode Mine.
* The Slayer Helper now properly displays your Wilderness Slayer streak when slaying on behalf of Krystilia.
* The 10th Anniversary Dragon Candle has been correctly labelled as a fun weapon.
* There is now a Fossil Storage Crate at the Volcanic Mine Bank.
* The Museum of Old School expansion in the Falador Party Room can now be accessed on free-to-play worlds.
* The Dragon Candle Dagger and Old School Jumper are now tagged as warm clothing.
* The animation that plays when waxing your Sled will now cancel if you move.
* The Sins of the Father display case in the Museum is now correctly labelled as a Master Quest.
* Having a Slayer Task streak of 16,000 no longer means you will get the max amount of Slayer Points for every task you complete. You ''will'' still get bonus Points at regular intervals as if you didn't have a ludicrous streak count, and completing a task will also inform you when you're next due to get a bump in Points!
* Fixed typos in the frog random event and Warmhandz’s dialogue.
* We updated the banners in the Falador Party Room to the correct versions!
* Facial animations have been added to those Birthday Event dialogues that previously didn't have them.

